# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Vite only exposes variables prefixed
# with VITE_, and it inlines them into the browser bundle at build time.
#
# That is the whole point of the provider-comparison lab: a stock
# provider needs its key shipped to the browser, which is why a static
# client-only app normally isn't possible. The runjobs side of that lab
# needs no key at all.
#
# Use a throwaway key with a low spend cap. Never deploy a build that
# has one of these inlined.

VITE_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
